261
00:18:07,208 --> 00:18:14,208
When we were talking about it, the mother of a little boy from Gogerhellen told us that her mother bought it for her.

262
00:18:14,208 --> 00:18:20,208
She asked me to buy some for her and eat it quickly!

263
00:18:20,208 --> 00:18:27,208
I've been so wrapped up in kindness all day today.

264
00:18:27,208 --> 00:18:29,208
It's raining so hard, it's coming out!

265
00:18:29,208 --> 00:18:33,208
Tears, my tears...

266
00:18:34,192 --> 00:18:36,192
Oh!

267
00:18:38,192 --> 00:18:43,192
Okonomiyaki? I heard it's wrapped in okonomiyaki.

268
00:18:43,192 --> 00:18:44,192
It's so delicious!

269
00:18:44,192 --> 00:18:46,192
I'll definitely make a mistake next time!

270
00:18:46,192 --> 00:18:48,192
Mmmmmm...

271
00:18:48,192 --> 00:18:50,192
Thank you. It's delicious.
